// AETHERIUM HUD (Owen-C137 BO7-remake kit, adopted 2026-07-03; docs/22, docs/49)
// Full stock-HUD replacement: the kit's .csc LuiLoads AetheriumHud.lua, which
// redefines LUI.createMenu.T7Hud_zm_factory (the usermap ZM HUD menu key, docs/28).
// This block is the kit's aetherium_hud.zpkg INLINED (dupes removed) - we don't use
// `include,` because our build compiles from the deployed usermap copy and this zone
// is the single manifest. Assets ship in the licensed Aetherium pack
// (model_export\_OwensAssets\bo7\aetherium_hud + its GDT; manifest entry
// "Aetherium HUD" in tools/external_assets_manifest.ps1). Perk row REWIRED to our
// accOwnedMask/accMegaMask + the Ronan i_acc_perk_* icons above (Mappings/
// AetheriumPerks.lua) - the kit's bl3_* perk icons are NOT shipped/used.
// Master flag: level.acc_aetherium_hud (_acc_lui.gsc) + its .csc twin
// ACC_AETHERIUM_HUD_ON (_zm_aetherium_hud.csc) - flip BOTH for the stock HUD back.
// ============================================================================
scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_zm_aetherium_hud.gsc
scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_zm_aetherium_hud.csc

